<title>PORTUGAL: Bourse annuls one minute of Portugal Telecom trade.</title>
<headline>Bourse annuls one minute of Portugal Telecom trade.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lisbon bourse said that it was annulling share trade in Portugal Telecom carried out between 12.03:58 and 12.04:37 gmt on Thursday because of a wrongly-inserted order.</p>
</text>
